# ModernTax — Netlify redirect map
# Fixes stale URLs still indexed by Google/Bing and held by LLM training data.
# Netlify serves these top-to-bottom; first match wins.
#
# NOTE: redirects declared in netlify.toml are evaluated BEFORE this file.
# The API proxies (/api/v1/verify, /employment-verify/*) and the /docs rules
# live there — do not duplicate them here.

# --- Sandbox host — DO NOT REMOVE ---
# Live API sandbox (Lendesca and other integrators point at this host).
# This was the only rule in the previous _redirects; dropping it takes the
# sandbox offline.
https://sandbox.moderntax.io/* /sandbox-interface.html 200!

# --- Legacy /solutions/* -> current /use-cases/* ---
# All four targets verified present in use-cases/.
/solutions/small-business      /use-cases/sba-7a                    301!
/solutions/government          /use-cases/tax-payment-verification  301!
/solutions/lending             /use-cases/commercial-lending        301!
/solutions/employment          /use-cases/employment-hr             301!
/solutions/*                   /use-cases/sba-7a                    301!

# --- Canonicalize host: force apex, strip www ---
https://www.moderntax.io/*     https://moderntax.io/:splat          301!

# --- HELD BACK: targets do not exist yet ---
# Redirecting an indexed URL to a 404 is worse than leaving it alone — Google
# treats it as a soft 404 and the old URL's equity is lost rather than passed.
# There is no /about page, and no /legal/ directory; terms.html and
# privacy.html exist only in an unmerged worktree. Uncomment each line as its
# target page actually ships.
#
# /company/about               /about                               301!
# /company/*                   /about                               301!
# /contact                     /about                               301!
# /terms                       /legal/terms                         301!
# /privacy                     /legal/privacy                       301!
